T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Statement: A right regular hexagonal prism, base edge 30 mm and axis height 70) Tj
T*
(mm, rests on HP with one base edge perpendicular to VP. A cutting plane inclined at 45) Tj
T*
(degrees to HP cuts the prism axis at a height of 40 mm from the base. Draw the) Tj
T*
