/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
([PROBLEM 3: Development of a Square-to-Round Transition Duct]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Statement: A sheet metal transition hopper connects a rectangular furnace flue) Tj
T*
(\(100 mm x 100 mm\) at the base to a circular exhaust duct \(dia 60 mm\) at the top,) Tj
T*
(vertical height 75 mm. Explain the Triangulation Development procedure.) Tj
T*
(Engineering Solution & Triangulation Procedure:) Tj
T*
(* 1. Symmetrical Decomposition: Due to 4-fold symmetry, divide the top circle into 12) Tj
T*
(equal parts \(3 per quadrant: 1, 2, 3, 4\). Each quadrant consists of a central flat) Tj
T*
(triangle and two transitional scalene triangles connected to base corner A.) Tj
T*
(* 2. True Length Calculation via Right Triangles:) Tj
T*
(- Plan length = sqrt\(\(X_top - X_base\)^2 + \(Y_top - Y_base\)^2\).) Tj
T*
(- True Length = sqrt\(\(Plan length\)^2 + \(Vertical Height 75\)^2\).) Tj
T*
(* 3. Successive Triangle Construction: Lay down base edge AB = 100 mm. Strike arc) Tj
T*
(from A with True Length A-1 and arc from B with True Length B-1 to locate apex 1.) Tj
T*
(Continue constructing adjacent triangles A-1-2 and A-2-3 sequentially.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
([PROBLEM 4: AutoCAD 3D Boolean Modeling & Mass Properties Analysis]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: Create a hydraulic valve manifold body with intersecting bores using) Tj
T*
(AutoCAD 3D Boolean tools and inspect mass properties.) Tj
T*
(AutoCAD Command Protocol:) Tj
T*
(* 1. BOX -> 0,0,0 -> Length 120 mm, Width 80 mm, Height 60 mm.) Tj
T*
(* 2. CYLINDER -> Center: 60,40,60 -> Radius: 20 mm -> Height: -60 mm \(Vertical fluid) Tj
T*
(chamber\).) Tj
T*
(* 3. UCS -> 3P -> Align with front face \(120 x 60 face\).) Tj
T*
(* 4. CYLINDER -> Center: 60,30,0 -> Radius: 12 mm -> Height: -80 mm \(Horizontal cross) Tj
T*
(bore\).) Tj
T*
(* 5. SUBTRACT Command: Select main Box -> Enter -> Select vertical and horizontal) Tj
T*
(cylinders -> Enter.) Tj
T*
(* 6. FILLETEDGE -> Select all 12 outer sharp edges -> Radius: 3 mm. \(Generates smooth) Tj
T*
(cast fillets\).) Tj
T*
(* 7. VISUALSTYLES -> Select "Shaded with Edges". Run 3DORBIT to inspect intersecting) Tj
T*
(internal cavity.) Tj
T*
(* 8. MASSPROP Command: Select final manifold solid -> AutoCAD outputs exact Volume) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
